id=netstats-fix
name=Network Stats Fix for GSI
version=v6
versionCode=6
author=opencode
description=Universal fix for broken traffic indicator and per-UID network stats on Android 16 GSIs. Patches SystemUI to read /proc/net/dev directly (works on all kernels), adds sepolicy rules for bpfloader, and provides xt_qtaguid fallback for kernels <5.0.
